<title>USA: Williamstown-KISTA, Ky., won by PNC Bank.</title>
<headline>Williamstown-KISTA, Ky., won by PNC Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Bank said it won $3.600 million of Williamstown Independent School District-Kentucky Interlocal School Transportation Authority (KISTA), Ky., lease program revenue 1997 convertible rate bonds, series A, with a rate of 4.875 percent.</p>
</text>
